{"id":"vod_sn_38984","vodId":"38984","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"数码宝贝3：驯兽师之王","name_cn":"数码宝贝3：驯兽师之王","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/08ada93edeaa2fed8679d3c397dffd81.jpg"},"summary":"松田启人（津村真琴 配音）是一个热爱幻想的五年级男生，一次偶然中，启人捡到了一张神奇的卡片，这张卡片将启人带往了生活着数码兽的数码世界，在那里，启人遇见了基尔兽，此时的他并不知道，基尔兽将会是他一生中最重要的搭档和朋友。　　为了保护数码世界和数码兽，四圣兽之一朱雀兽接连不断的将帝魔送往人类世界，造成了危险和混乱，启人和好友牧野留姬（折笠富美子 配音）、李健良（山口真弓 配音）一起为了保护和平加入了战斗之中。不仅如此，朱雀兽还带走了掌握着数码兽进化关键的古乐兽，追随着古乐兽的踪迹，启人一行人闯入了数码世界，展开了大冒险。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qfAw2zf80D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CEhhrCz62x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2KP503FLen1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uP4ARV3Kap1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g9gHdUshR91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z8g5rTkdfs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n1wbKsvdFP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yrL8WFw8hh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UxBeDkbcdn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KZ6eAnAkew1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nykFkirAGR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gCiP5x5nBB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qMePeFYASB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vN7LfD870E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"http